# The offline Bitbucket `mnml --demo` starts beside it. {{bitbucket}}
# (it ends in /2.0) and {{bitbucket_basic}} come from .mnml/env/dev.env.

### The workspace's repositories
GET {{bitbucket}}/repositories/acme
Authorization: Basic {{bitbucket_basic}}
Accept: application/json

### Open pull requests on api
GET {{bitbucket}}/repositories/acme/api/pullrequests
Authorization: Basic {{bitbucket_basic}}
Accept: application/json
